WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.810 --> 01:31.150
[My Journey to You]

01:31.160 --> 01:34.080
[Episode 23]

01:37.060 --> 01:37.539
Jin Fan.

01:45.000 --> 01:46.090
Chuyun Chonglian.

01:47.370 --> 01:48.220
We got it back.

02:13.950 --> 02:14.950
Give it to Jin Fan.

02:14.980 --> 02:15.610
No.

02:19.370 --> 02:21.570
Jin Fan risked his life to get it for you.

02:32.320 --> 02:33.620
Yun and I used energy to cure ourselves

02:33.620 --> 02:34.420
just now.

02:34.920 --> 02:36.320
We've almost recovered.

02:37.500 --> 02:38.390
We'll be fine.

02:39.000 --> 02:40.840
We don't need Chuyun Chonglian.

02:43.340 --> 02:43.850
Right?

02:44.560 --> 02:45.070
Yun.

02:57.380 --> 02:57.950
But

02:58.470 --> 03:00.640
Chuyun Chonglian is extremely precious.

03:00.640 --> 03:01.560
No matter what,

03:02.190 --> 03:04.120
it should be kept for Sword Wielder

03:05.150 --> 03:05.890
just in case.

03:17.020 --> 03:18.280
Jin Fan always tells me

03:20.780 --> 03:21.980
that he is my guardian

03:24.190 --> 03:25.050
and that my life

03:26.010 --> 03:27.810
is more important than his life.

03:29.500 --> 03:31.300
He said he can die for me anytime.

03:34.630 --> 03:35.370
So

03:38.470 --> 03:40.130
even though he likes someone,

03:41.370 --> 03:43.100
he has to suppress his feelings

03:44.060 --> 03:45.120
and can't respond.

04:01.350 --> 04:02.410
But he doesn't know

04:05.700 --> 04:06.670
in my heart,

04:11.020 --> 04:13.150
he's already one of my family members.

04:21.000 --> 04:21.730
His life

04:24.020 --> 04:25.560
is as important as mine.

04:52.760 --> 04:53.760
Give it to Jin Fan.

05:19.030 --> 05:21.950
I'd rather destroy the blueprint of the Infinite Heat

05:21.950 --> 05:23.420
than let you succeed.

05:48.100 --> 05:50.760
I have no intention of getting out of here alive.

06:54.960 --> 06:56.020
Can you protect it?

06:56.720 --> 06:59.450
I won't let that Wang get out of here once he comes.

07:00.120 --> 07:01.320
You're so confident.

07:02.670 --> 07:03.300
Of course.

07:07.830 --> 07:09.200
By order of Sword Wielder,

07:09.200 --> 07:12.130
we Red Jade guardians are here to be at your disposal.

07:49.900 --> 07:50.740
Father.

07:52.540 --> 07:53.820
Will you

07:54.560 --> 07:55.280
be proud

07:56.280 --> 07:58.530
of me?

09:50.810 --> 09:52.610
♫The sunset light falls♫

09:52.850 --> 09:55.580
♫A little ink on my heart♫

09:56.350 --> 09:59.970
♫Two ties of grudges becoming into three lives of mistakes♫

10:01.670 --> 10:02.090
Brother.

10:01.960 --> 10:03.870
♫The childhood music♫

10:03.880 --> 10:06.540
♫Singing about and old friend's song♫

10:07.010 --> 10:11.750
♫What can we do about this guest?♫

10:07.740 --> 10:08.270
Brother.

10:13.010 --> 10:15.160
♫Whose song♫

10:15.810 --> 10:17.910
♫Is matching every line?♫

10:17.800 --> 10:18.200
Brother.

10:18.160 --> 10:22.360
♫Fold it gently as the wound spreads♫

10:22.780 --> 10:23.310
Brother.

10:24.170 --> 10:26.270
♫We share the same hand and feet♫

10:26.650 --> 10:29.110
♫And the same bloodline♫

10:29.670 --> 10:30.620
♫How do we♫

10:30.910 --> 10:34.040
♫Tell the two of us apart♫

10:31.500 --> 10:32.030
Brother.

10:35.350 --> 10:36.290
♫Brother♫

10:36.460 --> 10:40.080
♫You always laugh at me lightly♫

10:38.560 --> 10:39.110
Brother.

10:40.070 --> 10:40.620
Brother.

10:40.710 --> 10:45.120
♫You teach me not to cry♫

10:43.840 --> 10:44.370
Brother.

10:44.820 --> 10:45.350
Brother.

10:46.730 --> 10:47.570
♫Brother♫

10:47.680 --> 10:51.230
♫You see through the world♫

10:51.250 --> 10:52.640
Somebody, help!

10:51.420 --> 10:54.170
♫But don't understand why♫

10:54.320 --> 10:56.510
♫I am sad♫

10:58.560 --> 10:59.090
Brother.

11:00.200 --> 11:01.800
Gong Shangjue!

11:02.620 --> 11:03.650
Wake up.

11:04.090 --> 11:04.660
Brother.

11:05.850 --> 11:07.260
I'm begging you.

11:08.270 --> 11:09.190
Brother.

11:18.710 --> 11:19.720
Wake up.

11:20.200 --> 11:20.850
Brother.

11:21.280 --> 11:23.540
♫Whose song♫

11:21.990 --> 11:23.460
I'm begging you.

11:24.050 --> 11:26.040
♫Is matching every line?♫

11:26.250 --> 11:30.430
♫Fold it gently as the wound spreads♫

11:32.730 --> 11:34.700
♫We share the same hand and feet♫

11:35.100 --> 11:37.470
♫And the same bloodline♫

11:37.980 --> 11:38.940
♫How do we♫

11:38.480 --> 11:41.760
[Gong]

11:39.130 --> 11:42.600
♫Tell the two of us apart♫

12:00.120 --> 12:00.980
Sword Wielder.

12:01.110 --> 12:02.620
The female family members,

12:02.620 --> 12:03.360
children, and elders who were hiding

12:03.360 --> 12:04.130
in the secret tunnel

12:04.130 --> 12:05.860
have all been taken out safely.

12:07.050 --> 12:07.710
Elder Hua,

12:08.380 --> 12:09.380
Young Master Hua,

12:09.430 --> 12:10.560
and Young Master Xue

12:11.340 --> 12:12.340
have been killed.

12:16.130 --> 12:16.930
You may leave.

12:17.520 --> 12:17.960
Yes.

12:32.640 --> 12:34.500
This is the Sword Wielder's gown.

12:41.110 --> 12:42.170
Can you protect it?

12:43.110 --> 12:45.840
I won't let that Wang get out of here once he comes.

12:46.470 --> 12:50.190
♫Will I see you again?♫

12:53.150 --> 12:56.240
♫The summer we spent together is a blur now♫

12:59.810 --> 13:03.510
♫Night breezes tousled your gray hair♫

13:06.360 --> 13:09.830
♫You looked at me in silence♫

13:12.390 --> 13:14.330
♫When you put your hands♫

13:14.450 --> 13:17.800
♫On my shoulders♫

13:19.370 --> 13:23.910
♫All my fear and hesitation were gone♫

13:20.550 --> 13:21.070
Father.

13:24.850 --> 13:25.400
Father.

13:25.670 --> 13:27.610
♫Snow falls♫

13:27.350 --> 13:28.820
I passed the Trial of the Three Realms.

13:27.650 --> 13:30.950
♫My wound will never close♫

13:31.810 --> 13:32.400
I know.

13:32.630 --> 13:36.960
♫I've been adrift for too long but now I'm home♫

13:37.020 --> 13:39.150
I also defeated people from the Wufeng

13:39.410 --> 13:41.010
and protected the back hill.

13:43.340 --> 13:44.140
I saw it.

13:45.300 --> 13:46.280
Well done.

13:50.650 --> 13:51.120
Father.

13:53.030 --> 13:56.390
♫Will you think of me sometimes?♫

13:59.770 --> 14:03.280
♫When the rain just stops and you feel lonely♫

14:01.010 --> 14:01.940
I miss you.

14:05.340 --> 14:06.290
I'm always here.

14:06.520 --> 14:09.900
♫New lives are beginning in the distant mountains in the fog♫

14:07.400 --> 14:07.840
I'm

14:09.080 --> 14:09.730
here.

14:11.910 --> 14:12.840
You've grown up.

14:13.030 --> 14:16.520
♫When tears are shed, they become flowers♫

14:14.500 --> 14:16.030
You need to be strong enough

14:17.270 --> 14:18.970
to protect your family

14:18.930 --> 14:21.030
♫On the porch, in the corridor♫

14:20.070 --> 14:20.930
and

14:21.050 --> 14:24.480
♫Our past is whispering♫

14:21.900 --> 14:22.710
your lover.

14:25.990 --> 14:30.340
♫I stare at the moon and keep thinking about you♫

14:26.940 --> 14:27.720
He will.

14:32.230 --> 14:34.230
♫Wine in my hand♫

14:34.250 --> 14:37.920
♫The old days slip through my fingers like sand♫

14:34.420 --> 14:35.970
He already did it.

14:39.380 --> 14:43.700
♫I drink to forget you but only miss you even more♫

14:45.490 --> 14:47.670
♫People come and people go♫

14:47.700 --> 14:50.930
♫When I walked past you♫

14:52.630 --> 14:56.980
♫I didn't know it'd be the last time I looked around and saw you♫

14:58.850 --> 15:00.850
♫I stumble to find you♫

15:00.870 --> 15:04.380
♫I have so much so say to you♫

15:05.990 --> 15:10.340
♫Thank you, and sorry♫

15:16.480 --> 15:20.090
♫Yesterday fades like a distant mountain♫

15:23.030 --> 15:25.490
♫Tears are the snow♫

15:26.840 --> 15:28.370
♫On the top of the mountain♫

16:12.340 --> 16:14.000
Jin Fan's life has been saved.

16:17.740 --> 16:18.470
Don't worry.

16:22.720 --> 16:23.850
Lord Sword Wielder.

16:24.070 --> 16:25.350
This is what Young Master Hua

16:25.350 --> 16:26.270
left you.

16:38.020 --> 16:39.480
This is my favorite saber.

16:39.850 --> 16:40.890
Our Hua family

16:41.060 --> 16:42.720
called it Clouds Weave Feathers.

16:42.720 --> 16:44.520
Because it's too light and thin.

16:44.660 --> 16:45.710
It's like a feather

16:45.710 --> 16:46.920
woven from clouds.

16:47.660 --> 16:49.170
After I become Sword Wielder,

16:49.170 --> 16:50.370
can I have this saber?

16:50.580 --> 16:52.180
If you pass the three trials,

16:52.350 --> 16:53.370
every saber here

16:53.650 --> 16:54.450
will be yours.

16:54.660 --> 16:55.120
No need.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.130
I just want this one.

17:04.660 --> 17:05.349
Let me do it.

17:20.430 --> 17:21.530
You once told me

17:22.660 --> 17:24.089
swords are double-edged.

17:24.089 --> 17:26.950
They hurt not only other people but also ourselves.

17:27.200 --> 17:28.800
I'm giving this saber to you.

17:30.650 --> 17:31.720
From now on,

17:32.470 --> 17:34.270
I won't allow anyone to hurt you,

17:35.710 --> 17:36.910
including yourself.

17:40.500 --> 17:41.360
What is the name

17:42.370 --> 17:43.590
of this saber?

17:49.030 --> 17:50.360
Clouds Weave Feathers.

17:51.050 --> 17:52.140
It's like a feather

17:52.920 --> 17:53.980
woven from clouds.

17:58.270 --> 17:59.870
Can I change the word "weave"

18:01.820 --> 18:03.150
into "know"?

18:07.560 --> 18:09.110
Clouds Know Feathers.

18:11.590 --> 18:12.450
Sword Wielder.

18:21.150 --> 18:22.940
The poison hasn't been removed yet.

18:22.940 --> 18:24.940
It's just temporarily suppressed.

18:25.020 --> 18:25.770
Gong Ziyu.

18:26.260 --> 18:27.410
Why did you lie to us?

18:28.990 --> 18:30.120
If I hadn't say that,

18:31.110 --> 18:32.270
you wouldn't have agreed

18:32.270 --> 18:34.470
to give the Chuyun Chonglian to Jin Fan.

18:35.670 --> 18:37.070
Even though you love him,

18:37.270 --> 18:39.470
it's still hard for you to make a choice.

18:44.520 --> 18:45.800
What's going on?

18:47.270 --> 18:49.030
Since the poison hasn't been removed,

18:49.030 --> 18:50.560
why are you getting better?

18:52.270 --> 18:53.860
When Yun treated me,

18:54.660 --> 18:56.460
she found a strange phenomenon.

18:58.380 --> 19:00.610
The mental techniques of me and Sword Wielder

19:00.610 --> 19:02.010
can be combined together

19:03.380 --> 19:04.870
and complement each other.

19:04.870 --> 19:06.550
They can be combined together?

19:06.550 --> 19:08.950
What mental technique are you practicing?

19:12.650 --> 19:13.980
The Brocade Heart Sutra

19:14.730 --> 19:15.930
of the Qingfeng Sect.

19:19.290 --> 19:20.460
Show me.

19:26.910 --> 19:28.700
The fast movement is real.

19:31.350 --> 19:34.350
It can combine with the mental technique of Sword Wielder.

19:34.350 --> 19:35.340
She's performing

19:35.340 --> 19:37.000
Three Forms of Wind Emission.

19:39.220 --> 19:40.590
[The fast movement is real.]

19:40.590 --> 19:41.660
Isn't this Qingfeng Nine Moves Sword

19:41.660 --> 19:42.860
of the Qingfeng Sect?

19:43.800 --> 19:45.590
[Real things have its energy.]

19:45.630 --> 19:47.230
Real things have its energy.

19:48.300 --> 19:49.760
Qingfeng Nine Moves Sword

19:50.150 --> 19:51.950
is Three Forms of Wind Emission.

19:52.270 --> 19:53.220
It used to be

19:53.280 --> 19:54.410
the saber technique

19:54.560 --> 19:55.950
used by the Feng family

19:55.570 --> 19:57.500
[If you want energy, be absorbed again.]

19:55.990 --> 19:56.890
who has fallen

19:56.910 --> 19:58.220
in the back hill.

19:58.450 --> 20:00.580
If you want energy, be absorbed again.

20:02.860 --> 20:05.840
Flowers, snow, and the moon are precious in the mortal world.

20:05.840 --> 20:07.130
A breeze sees us off.

20:07.550 --> 20:09.010
Please don't say goodbye.

20:10.110 --> 20:11.110
Aren't there only

20:11.220 --> 20:13.910
the Xue family, the Yue family, and the Hua family in the back hill?

20:13.910 --> 20:15.840
There were not only three families

20:15.910 --> 20:17.670
in the back hill.

20:18.370 --> 20:19.460
There were four families.

20:19.460 --> 20:20.130
The Feng family,

20:20.130 --> 20:20.630
the Hua family,

20:20.630 --> 20:21.290
the Xue family,

20:21.290 --> 20:22.350
and the Yue family.

20:23.680 --> 20:25.410
What the Feng family practiced

20:25.660 --> 20:27.520
was Three Forms of Wind Emission.

20:27.900 --> 20:29.230
The saber techniques in the back hill

20:29.230 --> 20:31.480
are not the nine forms you know.

20:32.190 --> 20:33.200
To be exact,

20:33.660 --> 20:34.920
there are 12 forms.

20:35.760 --> 20:38.600
The forms of the Xue, Yue, and Hua families are all offensive.

20:38.600 --> 20:41.800
Only the saber technique of the Feng family is auxiliary.

20:42.090 --> 20:42.780
So

20:43.240 --> 20:45.900
it's usually learnt by the Sword Wielder's wife

20:46.290 --> 20:48.070
to assist Sword Wielder.

20:48.870 --> 20:49.470
That's why

20:49.940 --> 20:51.670
the mental techniques of you and Sword Wielder

20:51.670 --> 20:53.000
can support each other,

20:53.100 --> 20:54.690
supplement each other,

20:55.340 --> 20:56.740
and suppress the poison.

20:57.510 --> 20:58.560
In that case,

20:59.000 --> 21:01.000
if Miss Yun's mental technique works,

21:01.000 --> 21:03.280
I'll be able to master Three Forms of Mirror Flower.

21:03.280 --> 21:04.080
That's right.

21:04.630 --> 21:05.600
The saber technique of the Feng family

21:05.600 --> 21:08.470
can be combined with any saber technique of the other three families

21:08.470 --> 21:10.370
to form a double saber technique.

21:10.760 --> 21:11.220
They're

21:11.600 --> 21:12.860
Three Forms of Wind Snow,

21:11.670 --> 21:16.960
[Three Forms of Wind Snow]

21:11.670 --> 21:16.960
[Three Forms of Wind Moon] [Three Forms of Wind Flower]

21:13.220 --> 21:14.590
Three Forms of Wind Moon,

21:14.590 --> 21:15.200
and

21:15.570 --> 21:17.100
Three Forms of Wind Flower.

21:17.700 --> 21:19.880
Miss Yun learnt it from the Wufeng.

21:21.020 --> 21:22.510
Then why can people from the Wufeng

21:22.510 --> 21:24.910
use the saber technique of the Feng family?

21:26.350 --> 21:27.720
Are there members of the Feng family who disappeared

21:27.720 --> 21:28.870
in the Wufeng?

21:30.350 --> 21:31.330
Wufeng.

21:36.370 --> 21:37.280
Wufeng.

21:41.380 --> 21:42.180
Young Master.

21:51.190 --> 21:52.430
Although you used your mental techniques

21:52.430 --> 21:54.490
to temporarily suppress the poison,

21:54.650 --> 21:56.780
your life will be in danger at any time.

21:56.800 --> 21:58.260
The poison might kill you.

22:00.490 --> 22:01.780
It doesn't matter.

22:02.850 --> 22:04.450
Jin Fan's life was in danger.

22:04.460 --> 22:05.460
I still have time.

22:06.340 --> 22:07.220
Besides,

22:08.080 --> 22:09.280
if I hadn't done this,

22:09.670 --> 22:11.070
you wouldn't have agreed

22:11.210 --> 22:13.410
to give the Chuyun Chonglian to Jin Fan.

22:14.360 --> 22:15.050
By the way,

22:16.210 --> 22:17.140
when he wakes up,

22:17.180 --> 22:18.580
don't tell him the truth.

22:19.110 --> 22:19.770
Otherwise,

22:20.810 --> 22:22.610
he'll tear down my Yu residence.

22:25.350 --> 22:26.130
Gong Ziyu.

22:27.150 --> 22:27.550
You...

22:28.670 --> 22:30.260
Don't look at me with tears.

22:30.470 --> 22:31.470
I'm not used to it.

22:32.300 --> 22:33.060
Besides,

22:33.330 --> 22:34.330
he already ate it.

22:34.550 --> 22:35.680
He can't spit it out.

22:50.460 --> 22:51.860
I'm returning the favor.

22:54.450 --> 22:55.980
You didn't let me thank you,

22:56.530 --> 22:58.590
but I don't like to owe people a favor.

23:01.910 --> 23:02.910
Open it yourself.

23:02.940 --> 23:03.800
My hand tendons

23:03.860 --> 23:04.760
are broken.

23:05.350 --> 23:07.210
Don't expect me to open it for you.

23:16.700 --> 23:17.760
Chuyun Chonglian?

23:17.830 --> 23:18.430
Let me see.

23:19.110 --> 23:20.330
Why is there another one?

23:20.330 --> 23:21.330
Didn't you eat it?

23:21.910 --> 23:23.330
I'm strong.

23:24.390 --> 23:25.720
I kept it for my brother.

23:26.340 --> 23:27.200
If

23:27.220 --> 23:29.240
my brother's life is in danger one day,

23:29.240 --> 23:29.700
I...

23:30.750 --> 23:31.380
Thank you.

23:32.680 --> 23:33.540
Don't thank me.

23:33.670 --> 23:35.270
You should thank my brother.

23:35.810 --> 23:36.860
This lotus is his.

23:37.560 --> 23:38.900
I just gave you a box.

24:11.130 --> 24:12.710
People from the Wufeng were defeated.

24:12.710 --> 24:14.870
The crisis in the Gong residence has been resolved.

24:14.870 --> 24:16.700
It's time to return the blueprint of the Infinite Heat

24:16.700 --> 24:18.880
to the Saber Tomb of the Hua residence.

25:19.100 --> 25:20.420
Go and get changed.

25:22.500 --> 25:23.200
I'm fine.

25:24.960 --> 25:26.820
But why is the blueprint missing?

25:28.780 --> 25:30.150
I know where it is.

25:33.030 --> 25:34.690
Why didn't you tell us earlier?

25:34.690 --> 25:36.470
You also asked Xue Chongzi to get in the water.

25:36.470 --> 25:37.540
So many people died

25:38.390 --> 25:39.850
because of the blueprint.

25:40.300 --> 25:41.700
Don't bother the living.

25:56.770 --> 25:58.630
Is it the same as what we expected?

26:12.060 --> 26:12.860
The blueprint

26:15.000 --> 26:16.260
is in the Yu residence.

26:43.220 --> 26:44.230
Ziyu.

26:45.760 --> 26:47.840
In your future life,

26:49.020 --> 26:51.940
you'll have many experiences of groping forward

26:51.940 --> 26:53.200
in the dark.

26:54.000 --> 26:55.430
At that time,

26:55.510 --> 26:57.570
there might be no one leading the way.

26:58.010 --> 26:59.740
When you're alone in the dark,

27:00.530 --> 27:02.130
no matter how hard it is,

27:02.150 --> 27:04.900
you have to make right choices.

27:06.420 --> 27:08.280
Because what you're shouldering

27:08.620 --> 27:10.620
is not your own fate,

27:11.250 --> 27:13.920
but the future of the whole Gong family.

27:55.350 --> 27:56.150
Ziyu.

27:58.580 --> 27:59.700
Why are you here?

28:09.820 --> 28:11.210
How are you feeling?

28:14.210 --> 28:15.790
You know I'm injured?

28:18.290 --> 28:19.050
Yesterday,

28:19.280 --> 28:20.710
I heard a loud noise.

28:21.780 --> 28:22.910
It felt like a fight.

28:23.840 --> 28:25.570
I was afraid you might get hurt.

28:28.480 --> 28:29.140
Last night,

28:30.560 --> 28:32.690
the four people at the Wang level came.

28:34.420 --> 28:35.520
Is everyone fine?

28:41.480 --> 28:42.480
Young Master Xue,

28:43.190 --> 28:44.190
Young Master Hua,

28:45.270 --> 28:46.400
and Elder Hua

28:48.420 --> 28:49.350
were all killed.

28:56.230 --> 28:58.890
There was such a great war in the Gong residence.

29:00.010 --> 29:01.570
But I couldn't do anything.

29:04.300 --> 29:06.070
I'm so useless.

29:07.640 --> 29:09.440
Brother, don't blame yourself.

29:12.100 --> 29:12.960
The Gong family

29:14.470 --> 29:15.520
has survived.

29:18.550 --> 29:20.580
People from the Wufeng had been waiting

29:20.580 --> 29:21.570
for decades.

29:22.940 --> 29:25.270
They had been looking for the best chance.

29:26.340 --> 29:28.290
Why did they suddenly attack here

29:29.740 --> 29:31.850
and almost use up all their power?

29:33.610 --> 29:36.760
All the four people at the Wang level came at the same time.

29:36.760 --> 29:39.160
This didn't happen in the war ten years ago.

29:43.380 --> 29:45.580
Because they wanted the Infinite Heat.

29:48.020 --> 29:49.220
Did they get it?

29:52.060 --> 29:52.580
No.

29:54.790 --> 29:55.730
Before the war,

29:57.220 --> 30:01.220
I already asked Xue Chongzi to transfer the blueprint to another place.

30:01.220 --> 30:02.040
That's good.

30:02.620 --> 30:03.210
But

30:08.300 --> 30:09.760
the blueprint is missing.

30:11.320 --> 30:11.930
What?

30:13.670 --> 30:15.070
This is a serious matter.

30:16.050 --> 30:18.630
You should send all the people in the Gong residence

30:18.630 --> 30:20.030
to search the whole hill.

30:25.900 --> 30:26.450
No need.

30:31.580 --> 30:33.710
I already know where the blueprint is.

30:35.920 --> 30:37.370
People with secrets

30:38.190 --> 30:39.580
always love darkness.

30:41.240 --> 30:42.240
Because darkness

30:43.000 --> 30:44.580
can hide their secrets.

30:46.740 --> 30:47.770
But sometimes,

30:48.970 --> 30:50.100
in the darkest hour,

30:51.950 --> 30:54.010
the secrets will emerge on their own.

30:56.620 --> 30:59.350
Brother, why did you suddenly turn out the light?

31:01.850 --> 31:03.910
When there's no moon, the sky is dark.

31:05.590 --> 31:06.960
When we look up,

31:07.060 --> 31:08.260
there are many stars.

31:11.580 --> 31:12.960
Father once said

31:14.750 --> 31:15.950
there is always light

31:16.580 --> 31:17.610
in the world

31:18.490 --> 31:20.220
which can let justice prevail.

31:32.460 --> 31:33.030
Brother.

31:34.020 --> 31:35.080
Do you remember it?

31:50.820 --> 31:53.550
I applied phosphorus stone powder to the iron box

31:54.140 --> 31:57.070
where the blueprint of the Infinite Heat was placed.

31:57.170 --> 31:58.410
Anyone who touched it

31:59.500 --> 32:00.700
would have it on them.

32:01.260 --> 32:02.570
It glows

32:02.950 --> 32:04.000
in the dark.

32:07.760 --> 32:08.960
Both Xue Chongzi and I

32:09.440 --> 32:11.040
touched the iron box before.

32:13.320 --> 32:14.100
But brother,

32:15.820 --> 32:16.680
what about you?

32:24.820 --> 32:25.470
Ziyu.

32:27.780 --> 32:30.200
I don't know why my hands are glowing.

32:31.770 --> 32:34.500
There must be someone who maliciously framed me.

32:37.400 --> 32:39.130
I lost all my martial art skills

32:39.230 --> 32:40.430
and internal skills.

32:41.690 --> 32:43.750
The water of the Ice Pool is freezing.

32:44.610 --> 32:47.090
How could I dive into it and get the iron box?

32:49.900 --> 32:50.620
Elder Yue,

32:51.540 --> 32:52.550
you can feel my pulse.

32:52.550 --> 32:53.080
Brother.

32:54.130 --> 32:55.740
I never told you

32:57.720 --> 33:00.320
the box was hidden at the bottom of the Ice Pool.

33:04.100 --> 33:05.430
But the four people at the Wang level

33:05.430 --> 33:07.290
all have strong internal skills.

33:07.470 --> 33:09.530
Even if their energy is consumed by the Ice Pool,

33:09.530 --> 33:10.390
in a moment,

33:11.190 --> 33:12.190
they'll recover.

33:14.340 --> 33:15.600
Who we need to be care of

33:16.730 --> 33:18.530
are not people at the Wang level,

33:20.750 --> 33:22.880
but a person without internal skills.

33:25.070 --> 33:25.720
Brother.

33:28.710 --> 33:31.240
Is there anything else you want to say to me...

33:33.140 --> 33:34.210
to us?

34:05.960 --> 34:07.260
When did you know it?

34:09.489 --> 34:12.020
When I investigated Housekeeper Jia before,

34:12.050 --> 34:13.330
I had too many doubts.

34:15.239 --> 34:15.730
First,

34:16.739 --> 34:17.810
I couldn't find the doctor

34:17.810 --> 34:19.090
who cured the son

34:19.110 --> 34:20.239
of Housekeeper Jia.

34:22.830 --> 34:23.310
Second,

34:24.380 --> 34:26.250
after Housekeeper Jia's son recovered,

34:26.250 --> 34:27.330
his physical condition changed dramatically,

34:27.330 --> 34:29.130
and he became extremely strong.

34:29.360 --> 34:30.730
I was puzzled

34:31.880 --> 34:32.909
until Elder Yue

34:33.630 --> 34:35.290
mentioned Chuyun Chonglian.

34:37.090 --> 34:38.090
Chuyun Chonglian

34:38.780 --> 34:40.380
was planted by Gong Yuanzhi.

34:41.380 --> 34:42.330
So I suspected

34:43.000 --> 34:45.770
that Gong Shangjue coveted the position of the Sword Wielder

34:45.770 --> 34:47.239
so he colluded with Gong Yuanzhi

34:47.239 --> 34:49.010
to kill my father.

34:51.230 --> 34:52.010
But later,

34:52.980 --> 34:54.620
I heard from Elder Yue

34:55.750 --> 34:56.320
that

34:57.390 --> 35:00.080
because you wanted to practice the Divine Stone Skill,

35:00.080 --> 35:01.740
Father gave Chuyun Chonglian

35:01.780 --> 35:02.470
to you.

35:03.990 --> 35:06.650
Since you were rescued from the ancestral hall,

35:06.990 --> 35:08.270
I've already been suspicious

35:08.270 --> 35:09.200
of you.

35:10.730 --> 35:11.930
But I dared not to ask

35:12.640 --> 35:13.570
or think about it

35:16.190 --> 35:17.320
until Gong Shangjue

35:18.900 --> 35:20.140
told me his guess.

35:22.790 --> 35:24.590
Of course I suspect Gong Huanyu.

35:25.900 --> 35:27.010
Chuyun Chonglian

35:27.350 --> 35:28.880
is the best evidence.

35:31.590 --> 35:32.540
Wasn't Lady Wuji

35:32.750 --> 35:34.350
the mastermind behind this?

35:35.670 --> 35:37.530
My brother was also killed by her.

35:38.270 --> 35:39.050
Then

35:39.740 --> 35:41.200
why did Lady Wuji

35:41.740 --> 35:42.870
write the word "Ren"

35:43.360 --> 35:44.290
before she died?

35:51.170 --> 35:53.030
Actually what she wanted to write

35:53.190 --> 35:54.190
was the word "Yu".

35:54.790 --> 35:56.250
But because of her scrawl,

35:56.490 --> 35:57.290
it looked like

35:57.710 --> 35:59.440
she wrote the word "Ren" twice.

36:00.960 --> 36:03.360
Gong Huanyu deliberately misread the word

36:03.380 --> 36:04.300
as "Ren".

36:04.310 --> 36:05.420
There're so many "Ren" on it.

36:05.420 --> 36:07.820
Because he was afraid we would suspect him.

36:09.350 --> 36:10.150
Besides,

36:11.530 --> 36:13.550
what Lady Wuji said before she died

36:14.770 --> 36:15.970
was not the word "Yun"

36:17.670 --> 36:18.670
but the word "Yu".

36:23.820 --> 36:25.400
I didn't want to alert him,

36:26.620 --> 36:28.820
so I deliberately said it was "Yun" first.

36:28.820 --> 36:29.240
Yun.

36:30.970 --> 36:33.100
It was impossible for the dying person

36:33.470 --> 36:35.040
to write the word "Ren"

36:36.470 --> 36:37.670
when she said the word

36:38.630 --> 36:39.540
"Yu".

36:45.110 --> 36:47.100
The word Wuji wrote and said

36:48.000 --> 36:49.180
was "Yu".

36:51.350 --> 36:51.810
Yu.

36:52.060 --> 36:53.320
Think about it.

36:54.980 --> 36:56.180
If it's the word "Yu",

36:57.780 --> 36:58.610
besides you,

36:59.600 --> 37:01.060
who else has it in his name?

37:03.760 --> 37:05.510
If there were just the word "Yu",

37:05.510 --> 37:06.980
I could still defend you.

37:08.030 --> 37:09.710
But after Sister Zishang woke up,

37:09.710 --> 37:11.840
she identified you as the real culprit

37:11.890 --> 37:13.360
who killed Lady Wuji

37:14.310 --> 37:15.720
and wanted to blow her up.

37:16.200 --> 37:17.330
Lord Sword Wielder.

37:17.990 --> 37:19.450
Eldest Young Miss woke up.

37:24.500 --> 37:25.040
Sister.

37:29.100 --> 37:29.760
Be careful.

37:33.780 --> 37:34.710
Don't be afraid.

37:34.860 --> 37:35.720
Take your time.

37:36.450 --> 37:37.690
It's your eldest brother...

37:37.690 --> 37:38.160
It's...

37:40.170 --> 37:41.410
It's Gong Huanyu.

37:43.030 --> 37:44.600
He blew up the research lab.

37:45.610 --> 37:46.670
He wants to kill me.

37:47.820 --> 37:49.020
That day in your room,

37:49.350 --> 37:51.900
I saw the birthmark on his back by accident.

37:53.620 --> 37:57.280
It's exactly the same as that of the man I saw in the ancestral hall.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.210
He knew I stumbled on it,

38:04.120 --> 38:06.100
so he tried to kill me.

38:11.730 --> 38:13.190
You gave Chuyun Chonglian

38:13.390 --> 38:14.210
to Housekeeper Jia

38:14.210 --> 38:15.210
and saved his son.

38:16.980 --> 38:18.180
He was thus bribed

38:19.210 --> 38:21.470
into replacing my father's Herb Elixir.

38:26.560 --> 38:27.490
Young Master.

38:28.390 --> 38:29.850
Thank you for saving my son

38:30.430 --> 38:32.050
with Chuyun Chonglian.

38:39.820 --> 38:40.680
Hide the poison

38:40.870 --> 38:42.000
between your teeth.

38:42.840 --> 38:43.540
When you bite it,

38:43.540 --> 38:44.760
you'll die

38:46.480 --> 38:47.740
without feeling pain.

39:01.820 --> 39:02.350
Brother.

39:03.290 --> 39:04.840
Father and Sister Zishang

39:05.740 --> 39:07.470
are your close family members.

39:08.560 --> 39:10.810
You don't care about your family

39:10.890 --> 39:12.050
at all?

39:14.340 --> 39:16.480
People who want to achieve great things

39:16.480 --> 39:18.120
shouldn't care about love.

39:19.950 --> 39:21.150
Since ancient times,

39:22.400 --> 39:24.800
great achievements have come with a price.

39:26.270 --> 39:28.330
If the former sword wielders knew it,

39:30.280 --> 39:31.900
they would understand me.

39:32.170 --> 39:33.500
Your great achievement

39:34.340 --> 39:36.740
is to get the blueprint of the Infinite Heat

39:36.780 --> 39:38.110
and dominate the world?

39:39.550 --> 39:40.260
Yes

39:42.700 --> 39:43.600
and no.

39:45.980 --> 39:47.150
All these years,

39:48.860 --> 39:50.310
I've been working so hard

39:51.460 --> 39:53.020
for the Infinite Heat.

39:54.360 --> 39:56.490
But I don't want to dominate the world.

39:59.700 --> 40:00.500
My parents

40:01.780 --> 40:03.960
died for the Gong family.

40:06.550 --> 40:07.870
It's a blood feud.

40:09.570 --> 40:10.700
I must take revenge.

40:11.380 --> 40:13.590
We have absolute power,

40:15.620 --> 40:16.690
but we did nothing.

40:18.960 --> 40:21.020
You only want to protect yourselves.

40:21.380 --> 40:24.040
The former Sword Wielder was a traditionalist.

40:24.190 --> 40:25.900
I could only be a good son

40:27.580 --> 40:28.640
and a good brother.

40:29.680 --> 40:31.340
I practiced martial arts hard

40:31.930 --> 40:35.460
because I wanted to become the young lord of the Gong residence,

40:36.170 --> 40:38.190
become the Sword Wielder,

40:38.710 --> 40:40.840
lead the Gong family to the right path,

40:41.300 --> 40:42.540
activate the Infinite Heat,

40:42.540 --> 40:44.000
and eliminate the Wufeng.

40:44.700 --> 40:45.860
Only in this way

40:47.140 --> 40:49.530
can the Gong family enjoy eternal peace

40:53.310 --> 40:55.710
and the disputes in the world come to an end.

41:00.480 --> 41:01.610
The Gong family

41:02.940 --> 41:04.940
shouldn't have lived in this valley

41:06.760 --> 41:09.030
for generations

41:10.520 --> 41:11.570
fearfully

41:11.610 --> 41:13.590
under the shadow of the Wufeng.

41:15.210 --> 41:17.070
In order to get Father's approval

41:20.080 --> 41:23.940
and make a breakthrough at the eighth level of the Divine Stone Skill,

41:24.140 --> 41:25.540
I forcibly used my power,

41:26.210 --> 41:27.480
which almost

41:28.090 --> 41:29.260
drove me crazy.

41:30.210 --> 41:31.670
Although I made a mistake,

41:33.000 --> 41:35.140
I understood the true meaning

41:35.170 --> 41:36.630
of the Divine Stone Skill.

41:36.680 --> 41:38.210
That's not understanding.

41:39.700 --> 41:41.410
That's craziness.

41:45.520 --> 41:46.910
Being a god or a demon

41:47.390 --> 41:48.380
is just a choice.

41:49.600 --> 41:51.660
In this world, strength and weakness

41:53.130 --> 41:54.700
came before good and evil.

41:58.950 --> 41:59.540
Huanyu.

42:00.690 --> 42:01.150
Father.

42:03.190 --> 42:03.990
Wait a minute.

42:16.280 --> 42:16.940
Here you go.

42:18.780 --> 42:19.540
This is...

42:25.920 --> 42:27.440
Chuyun Chonglian.

42:28.740 --> 42:30.320
I got this from Shangjue.

42:31.030 --> 42:32.020
Eat it.

42:32.480 --> 42:34.060
It'll be a help to you

42:34.330 --> 42:36.330
when you practice internal skills.

42:36.490 --> 42:37.550
Thank you, Father.

42:46.930 --> 42:47.860
But at that time,

42:48.430 --> 42:50.490
I already mastered internal skills.

42:51.030 --> 42:53.290
I didn't need Chuyun Chonglian anymore.

42:54.480 --> 42:56.140
After I became the young lord,

42:56.540 --> 42:58.600
I asked Father countless times

42:58.930 --> 43:00.660
to activate the Infinite Heat.

43:03.110 --> 43:04.170
Unfortunately...

43:08.470 --> 43:09.020
Father.

43:10.990 --> 43:12.460
Are we going to stay in this valley fearfully

43:12.460 --> 43:13.530
forever?

43:16.430 --> 43:18.530
Wufeng caused so many blood feuds.

43:19.270 --> 43:20.110
Why don't we

43:20.130 --> 43:23.060
activate the Infinite Heat to eliminate the Wufeng?

43:23.410 --> 43:25.670
Shouldn't we avenge our parents' death?

43:28.470 --> 43:30.200
You just became the young lord.

43:30.630 --> 43:32.960
You don't need to care about these things.

43:33.390 --> 43:34.310
You should

43:34.790 --> 43:35.870
learn more

43:35.890 --> 43:38.090
about how to manage the Gong residence.

43:39.940 --> 43:40.490
Father.

43:41.640 --> 43:42.880
The elders are stubborn.

43:42.880 --> 43:43.830
Are you the same?

43:43.850 --> 43:44.580
How dare you!

43:48.850 --> 43:49.910
I'm sorry, Father.

43:50.820 --> 43:52.820
I shouldn't have contradicted you.

43:53.390 --> 43:54.440
You've been

43:55.220 --> 43:56.280
strange and cranky

43:57.250 --> 43:58.490
recently.

44:00.220 --> 44:00.870
If

44:00.890 --> 44:01.750
the Divine Stone Skill

44:01.750 --> 44:03.540
can't calm you down,

44:06.480 --> 44:08.210
stop practicing it for a while.

44:11.560 --> 44:12.130
Yes.

44:14.150 --> 44:14.650
Go.

44:20.680 --> 44:21.980
Since then,

44:22.450 --> 44:23.350
Father had been thinking about

44:23.350 --> 44:24.780
changing the heir.

44:26.100 --> 44:28.310
He gave me no choice.

44:52.630 --> 44:54.670
The Gong family originally had high hopes

44:54.670 --> 44:56.690
for the young lord, Gong Huanyu.

44:57.430 --> 44:57.960
However,

44:58.180 --> 44:59.230
he has no morals

44:59.480 --> 45:00.940
and can't be disciplined.

45:01.310 --> 45:02.510
Only Gong Shangjue

45:02.740 --> 45:04.200
can inherit the position.

45:07.820 --> 45:09.360
Father already prepared a document secretly

45:09.360 --> 45:11.540
to change my position.

45:13.020 --> 45:15.830
Once the document was handed over to the Council of Elders,

45:15.830 --> 45:17.760
it would be a foregone conclusion.

45:18.980 --> 45:20.750
So I couldn't wait any longer.

45:37.300 --> 45:38.060
Back then,

45:38.140 --> 45:39.380
I tried my best

45:39.760 --> 45:41.820
to pass the Trial of the Three Realms.

45:42.530 --> 45:44.190
I also promised Gong Liushang

45:44.990 --> 45:46.790
when I become the Sword Wielder,

45:48.060 --> 45:50.720
I'd help him reinvigorate the Shang residence.

45:52.560 --> 45:54.660
That's how I got the secret

45:54.680 --> 45:56.610
of passing the Trial of the Three Realms

45:56.610 --> 45:57.770
from him.

46:00.220 --> 46:02.010
If Gong Hongyu

46:02.030 --> 46:05.290
passed the position of the Sword Wielder to Gong Shangjue,

46:06.970 --> 46:09.680
all my efforts would be in vain.

46:12.870 --> 46:13.710
So

46:15.160 --> 46:18.020
I could only choose one who is the least threatening

46:21.820 --> 46:24.620
to temporarily take over from me as Sword Wielder.

46:25.310 --> 46:26.040
It's me.

46:28.330 --> 46:29.510
In your eyes,

46:31.050 --> 46:32.710
the least threatening person

46:34.220 --> 46:34.970
is me.

46:38.310 --> 46:39.600
On Zheng Nanyi,

46:39.780 --> 46:42.910
I put a letter with the information on the Infinite Heat.

46:43.150 --> 46:45.080
Although there are not many words,

46:45.860 --> 46:47.540
it's about the Infinite Heat.

46:48.940 --> 46:49.830
It could definitely

46:49.830 --> 46:52.030
force Gong Shangjue to leave the valley

46:53.310 --> 46:55.270
and ensure the Absent Inheritance

46:55.310 --> 46:56.770
would work successfully.

46:59.140 --> 47:00.250
Gong Ziyu

47:02.140 --> 47:04.400
could thus become the new Sword Wielder.

47:06.990 --> 47:07.470
Father,

47:08.250 --> 47:09.790
a secret letter was found

47:09.830 --> 47:11.090
from Miss Zheng Nanyi.

47:11.740 --> 47:12.940
It mentioned

47:15.230 --> 47:16.290
the Infinite Heat.

47:19.530 --> 47:19.990
Huanyu.

47:20.480 --> 47:22.480
Bring the female assassin here now.

47:22.770 --> 47:24.830
I'm going to interrogate her myself.

47:27.920 --> 47:29.010
In your eyes,

47:30.690 --> 47:32.310
I'm just a pawn?

47:34.910 --> 47:36.430
This is my first step.

47:39.390 --> 47:40.860
In order to force the elders

47:40.860 --> 47:43.060
to agree to activate the Infinite Heat,

47:44.160 --> 47:45.610
the Gong family must be made

47:45.610 --> 47:47.580
to feel the threat of the Wu Feng.

47:49.730 --> 47:50.420
Only when the Gong family

47:50.420 --> 47:52.410
was torn apart by the Wufeng

47:53.660 --> 47:56.190
could the Infinite Heat be shown to the world.

47:58.260 --> 47:59.100
And I

48:00.520 --> 48:02.840
happened to know there was another suitable pawn

48:02.840 --> 48:04.100
in the Gong residence.

48:06.240 --> 48:06.890
Was it

48:08.910 --> 48:10.100
Lady Wuji?

48:12.250 --> 48:12.770
Yes.

48:14.260 --> 48:16.390
Although she had betrayed the Wufeng,

48:16.770 --> 48:18.300
as long as they were humans,

48:18.400 --> 48:19.600
they had weaknesses.

48:20.510 --> 48:21.560
When I found their weaknesses,

48:21.560 --> 48:22.760
I could control them.

48:23.850 --> 48:24.830
The weakness of Housekeeper Jia

48:24.830 --> 48:26.140
was his sick son.

48:27.370 --> 48:28.680
The weakness of Wuji

48:29.870 --> 48:31.270
was her younger brother.

49:20.740 --> 49:26.640
[Gong Hongyu lied to you. Your father and younger brother are still alive.]

49:20.740 --> 49:26.640
[This new sword is a proof. If you want to save them, do as I say. Find the Infinite Heat.]

49:24.210 --> 49:26.080
I impersonated a person from the Wufeng

49:26.080 --> 49:27.940
and wrote a secret letter to Wuji.

49:29.040 --> 49:29.900
I lied to her

49:31.160 --> 49:32.760
that her brother is not dead.

49:33.600 --> 49:35.150
To save her brother,

49:36.350 --> 49:39.140
she must help the Wufeng find the Infinite Heat.

49:41.940 --> 49:44.070
The Herb Elixir was already replaced.

49:44.960 --> 49:47.220
The assassin from the Wufeng was caught.

49:48.540 --> 49:50.000
Wuji could be controlled.

49:55.030 --> 49:57.300
The game was almost ready.

49:58.260 --> 49:59.820
You just entered the Gong residence.

49:59.820 --> 50:00.700
How do you know

50:00.780 --> 50:01.840
the Infinite Heat?

50:06.600 --> 50:08.130
This hairpin is poisonous.

51:09.340 --> 51:10.090
Huanyu.

51:11.440 --> 51:12.150
Huanyu.

51:12.590 --> 51:13.980
What happened?

51:15.960 --> 51:16.590
I...

51:17.320 --> 51:19.470
I killed the assassin from the Wufeng.

51:21.060 --> 51:21.860
Hang in there.

51:22.110 --> 51:23.100
I'll go and ask the elders to come.

51:23.100 --> 51:23.690
No.

51:24.970 --> 51:25.790
No.

51:27.030 --> 51:28.390
If you tell the elders,

51:29.630 --> 51:31.160
they'll only avoid the war.

51:33.880 --> 51:35.940
Only by activating the Infinite Heat

51:37.600 --> 51:40.500
can I avenge my father's death.

51:41.990 --> 51:43.120
Infinite Heat?

51:45.100 --> 51:46.550
Do as I say.

51:47.740 --> 51:49.340
I'll definitely get justice

51:50.870 --> 51:52.390
for my father.

51:53.270 --> 51:55.750
Although Wuji didn't completely believe me,

51:55.750 --> 51:57.480
because of that secret letter,

51:58.820 --> 52:00.280
she must cooperate with me

52:00.870 --> 52:02.450
for her brother.

52:04.280 --> 52:06.210
The first step to cooperate with me

52:06.990 --> 52:09.990
was to use winter cicada grass to help me fake my death.

52:12.580 --> 52:14.280
After the funeral,

52:14.680 --> 52:15.640
as promised,

52:16.650 --> 52:18.110
Wuji came to the back hill,

52:18.540 --> 52:20.620
rescued me from the coffin,

52:21.130 --> 52:23.400
and hid me in the ancestral hall of the back hill.

52:23.400 --> 52:24.070
And she

52:24.990 --> 52:27.350
continued to create chaos in the front hill

52:27.350 --> 52:28.420
and cause panic.

52:29.110 --> 52:29.990
I told her

52:30.370 --> 52:33.060
Gong Shangjue coveted the position of the Sword Wielder

52:33.060 --> 52:34.580
so he ordered Gong Yuanzhi

52:34.740 --> 52:36.870
to replace Gong Hongyu's Herb Elixir.

52:36.950 --> 52:39.550
I told her that's why the former Sword Wielder died of poison.

52:39.550 --> 52:40.900
She believed it.

52:42.370 --> 52:43.770
In order to help Gong Ziyu

52:43.880 --> 52:44.870
get something

52:44.910 --> 52:46.840
on Gong Shangjue and Gong Yuanzhi,

52:47.140 --> 52:49.160
she put her own Wufeng token

52:50.190 --> 52:52.200
into Housekeeper Jia's room.

52:54.030 --> 52:54.760
And this

52:55.730 --> 52:57.200
was exactly what I wanted.

52:58.380 --> 53:00.080
The more you fought,

53:02.080 --> 53:04.410
the more it would be beneficial to my plan.

53:10.020 --> 53:11.320
In order to continue to create the illusion

53:11.320 --> 53:12.850
that assassins stormed in,

53:13.630 --> 53:15.960
I asked Wuji to meet Elder Yue late at night

53:16.490 --> 53:18.820
and tell him the secrets she was going to share was so important

53:18.820 --> 53:20.750
that they needed to meet in private

53:21.090 --> 53:23.350
without Yellow Jade guardians present.

53:31.170 --> 53:33.420
Wuji killed Elder Yue by accident.

53:33.760 --> 53:34.730
This life

53:34.980 --> 53:36.280
became the reason for her

53:36.280 --> 53:37.610
being threatened by me.

53:47.390 --> 53:49.830
After Wuji was suspected of being Anonymous,

53:49.830 --> 53:50.730
I told her

53:51.390 --> 53:53.120
if she wanted to clear her name,

53:53.300 --> 53:55.500
she had to write with blood on the wall.

53:56.150 --> 53:57.080
Unfortunately,

53:57.810 --> 53:59.220
Shangguan Qian saw it.

54:02.390 --> 54:03.550
But because of this,

54:04.260 --> 54:05.840
they confirmed their identities

54:05.840 --> 54:07.350
in the Wufeng

54:08.510 --> 54:10.040
and began to work together.

54:12.020 --> 54:13.550
Everything

54:14.310 --> 54:16.660
was going the way I wanted.

54:19.200 --> 54:20.480
Every month,

54:20.650 --> 54:23.090
Wuji came to the ancestral hall in the back hill

54:23.090 --> 54:24.620
to report the progress to me

54:24.980 --> 54:27.440
in the name of visiting Gong Hongyu's grave.

54:28.110 --> 54:30.550
When you finally came to the third trial,

54:32.770 --> 54:34.410
because of Yun Weishan,

54:35.740 --> 54:39.460
there was a fierce confrontation between the front hill and the back hill.

54:39.460 --> 54:40.780
For me,

54:41.430 --> 54:43.340
it was the perfect opportunity.

54:48.010 --> 54:48.740
I heard

54:49.040 --> 54:50.770
Ziyu fell in love with someone.

54:55.800 --> 54:57.500
Father left this to me before.

54:59.400 --> 55:00.110
He asked me

55:00.380 --> 55:01.510
to give it to my wife.

55:04.060 --> 55:04.770
Now,

55:08.510 --> 55:10.510
please give it to Yun Weishan for me.

55:12.060 --> 55:13.160
It can fulfil

55:13.980 --> 55:15.440
one of my father's wishes.

55:38.010 --> 55:40.780
Yun Weishan is the one you cherish the most.

55:42.380 --> 55:43.720
If she was killed...

55:43.750 --> 55:44.650
Who hurt you?

55:45.510 --> 55:46.290
Lady Wuji.

55:46.410 --> 55:48.850
If she were killed by Anonymous,

55:49.190 --> 55:51.880
you would try your best to avenge her death.

55:52.740 --> 55:53.940
If you had a nervous breakdown,

55:53.940 --> 55:56.330
you would activate the Infinite Heat.

55:56.880 --> 55:57.820
Unfortunately,

55:57.930 --> 55:59.520
she managed to dodge it.

55:59.880 --> 56:00.700
Actually,

56:02.470 --> 56:04.590
Yun was also hit by your hidden weapon.

56:04.590 --> 56:05.180
Oh?

56:06.200 --> 56:07.780
She's still alive?

56:08.790 --> 56:09.630
Did you forget

56:10.550 --> 56:12.080
this is the Gong residence?

56:12.300 --> 56:14.340
There are geniuses who can detoxify all poisons here.

56:14.340 --> 56:15.030
Oh.

56:16.810 --> 56:18.350
You mean Young Master Yue.

56:19.460 --> 56:21.120
He can't detoxify the poison.

56:21.630 --> 56:23.030
There's another genius.

56:26.230 --> 56:27.760
I've taken the Herb Elixir,

56:28.480 --> 56:31.140
but the poison hasn't been completely removed.

56:31.310 --> 56:32.570
If I can't detoxify it,

56:34.630 --> 56:36.400
we can only beg someone else.

56:38.980 --> 56:40.710
I really don't want to save you.

56:41.820 --> 56:43.750
But my brother told me your plan.

56:44.690 --> 56:45.620
If you die,

56:46.540 --> 56:48.200
my brother's plan won't work.

57:02.590 --> 57:03.180
Wait.

57:04.380 --> 57:05.580
You'll get poisoned.

57:06.120 --> 57:08.180
I'm doing this for getting poisoned.

57:08.410 --> 57:10.180
I need to know how my body reacts

57:10.640 --> 57:12.900
before prescribing the right medicine.

57:13.020 --> 57:14.450
Do you think it's easy to be

57:14.450 --> 57:15.380
a poison genius?

57:52.530 --> 57:53.790
But it doesn't matter.

57:55.290 --> 57:57.580
It didn't affect my next move.

57:58.120 --> 57:58.980
Thank you

57:59.090 --> 58:00.550
for helping me many times.

58:01.510 --> 58:02.260
Now,

58:02.390 --> 58:04.130
I have one last thing to ask for.

58:05.940 --> 58:06.540
What is it?

58:07.600 --> 58:08.710
Please

58:09.680 --> 58:10.620
die.

58:35.540 --> 58:36.680
You are so vicious

58:37.430 --> 58:39.760
that you killed Lady Wuji after using her.

58:41.110 --> 58:42.840
Even though she was Anonymous,

58:43.190 --> 58:44.950
she never really hurt us.

58:45.630 --> 58:46.930
And she was your foster mother.

58:46.930 --> 58:48.340
You're soft like a woman.

58:50.040 --> 58:51.190
The hands of every person from the Wufeng

58:51.190 --> 58:53.860
have been stained with the blood of the Gong family.

58:53.860 --> 58:55.390
But after you were rescued,

58:55.580 --> 58:56.580
I felt your pulse.

58:56.910 --> 58:58.480
You really had no internal power.

58:58.480 --> 58:59.830
And your tendons were all broken.

58:59.830 --> 59:00.630
Why is that?

59:01.490 --> 59:02.540
If people want to reach

59:02.540 --> 59:04.750
the tenth level of the Divine Stone Skill,

59:04.750 --> 59:06.150
they have to give up

59:07.250 --> 59:08.820
their martial art skills.

59:10.330 --> 59:11.330
I hadn't been able

59:11.590 --> 59:13.420
to find the right time.

59:15.020 --> 59:16.620
It wasn't until I killed Wuji

59:17.410 --> 59:18.650
that I realized

59:18.970 --> 59:20.120
the time had come.

59:20.650 --> 59:22.850
So after I gave up my martial art skills,

59:23.150 --> 59:25.480
I deliberately shouted in the secret room

59:26.110 --> 59:27.670
so that the guardians could hear me

59:27.670 --> 59:28.650
and rescue me.

59:30.080 --> 59:31.620
I asked you to diagnose me

59:32.250 --> 59:34.280
because I wanted to make you believe

59:35.380 --> 59:36.870
that I lost all my martial art skills

59:36.870 --> 59:38.470
and that what I said was true.

59:38.490 --> 59:39.770
Then I told you

59:40.460 --> 59:41.830
that I was afraid of light

59:41.830 --> 59:42.500
and wind

59:44.120 --> 59:46.120
and wanted to move to this basement.

59:47.290 --> 59:49.350
It's because this place is isolated.

59:51.220 --> 59:53.780
It was the perfect place for me to practice

59:53.820 --> 59:55.320
and reach the tenth level.

59:56.530 --> 59:57.630
Everything went

59:57.670 --> 59:59.120
according to my plan

01:00:01.410 --> 01:00:02.730
until Gong Zishang

01:00:04.180 --> 01:00:05.230
accidentally

01:00:06.700 --> 01:00:08.070
discovered

01:00:08.090 --> 01:00:10.750
that I was the man in black in the ancestral hall.

01:00:13.320 --> 01:00:14.500
Gong Shangjue

01:00:14.900 --> 01:00:16.930
has always been a big threat to me.

01:00:18.070 --> 01:00:19.270
I wanted you

01:00:19.710 --> 01:00:20.480
and him

01:00:20.880 --> 01:00:23.010
to completely turn against each other

01:00:23.070 --> 01:00:24.930
because of Gong Zishang's death.

01:00:25.860 --> 01:00:26.700
Gong Shangjue

01:00:26.700 --> 01:00:27.920
has a weakness.

01:00:29.160 --> 01:00:30.320
That's you.

01:01:01.140 --> 01:01:02.460
So it was you

01:01:03.340 --> 01:01:04.470
who stole my gloves.

01:01:12.740 --> 01:01:14.940
But I'm also one of your family members.

01:01:19.190 --> 01:01:21.190
When you don't have enough ability,

01:01:22.480 --> 01:01:24.040
don't be too kind.

01:01:26.100 --> 01:01:27.360
You don't understand.

01:01:28.180 --> 01:01:29.650
If you hadn't forced me...

01:01:29.670 --> 01:01:31.580
In order to get the Infinite Heat,

01:01:32.210 --> 01:01:35.280
you revealed the location of the Saber Tomb to Shangguan Qian,

01:01:35.280 --> 01:01:37.050
causing people from the Wufeng to break in

01:01:37.050 --> 01:01:38.540
and kill countless people.

01:01:38.540 --> 01:01:39.920
Did we force you

01:01:40.070 --> 01:01:42.270
to collude with people from the Wufeng?

01:01:48.450 --> 01:01:49.250
It seems

01:01:49.540 --> 01:01:52.130
that there're many people in the Gong residence

01:01:52.130 --> 01:01:53.190
who can really act.

01:01:54.520 --> 01:01:55.240
Wuji

01:01:55.450 --> 01:01:56.920
has told me your identity.

01:01:57.970 --> 01:01:59.170
What if I don't admit?

01:01:59.420 --> 01:02:00.420
You don't have to.

01:02:01.120 --> 01:02:02.380
I'm here to help you.

01:02:03.690 --> 01:02:04.310
Oh?

01:02:05.790 --> 01:02:07.360
You're here for the Infinite Heat,

01:02:07.360 --> 01:02:07.760
right?

01:02:10.980 --> 01:02:11.770
Wufeng.

01:02:12.190 --> 01:02:14.630
How do people from the Wufeng know there is Infinite Heat

01:02:14.630 --> 01:02:16.350
in the Gong residence?

01:02:18.500 --> 01:02:19.710
You're so deep.

01:02:20.130 --> 01:02:21.460
I won't hide it anymore.

01:02:22.360 --> 01:02:23.330
The chief of the Wufeng

01:02:23.330 --> 01:02:26.270
does know that there is Infinite Heat in the Gong residence.

01:02:26.270 --> 01:02:27.910
It seems

01:02:28.350 --> 01:02:30.150
that it was never a secret to her.

01:02:32.820 --> 01:02:33.600
My goal

01:02:34.780 --> 01:02:36.170
is also to get the Infinite Heat.

01:02:36.170 --> 01:02:37.830
It belongs to your own family.

01:02:37.930 --> 01:02:38.940
Can't you get it?

01:02:40.220 --> 01:02:40.890
I know

01:02:41.540 --> 01:02:43.670
you're an orphan from the Gushan Sect.

01:02:44.150 --> 01:02:45.810
If you have the Infinite Heat,

01:02:46.780 --> 01:02:48.020
you can take revenge.

01:02:50.600 --> 01:02:51.860
We have the same goal.

01:02:52.800 --> 01:02:55.060
We also have blood feuds with the Wufeng.

01:02:56.690 --> 01:02:58.220
Compared to Gong Shangjue,

01:02:59.190 --> 01:03:02.050
I'm the most suitable person to cooperate with you.

01:03:08.460 --> 01:03:09.910
My original goal

01:03:10.710 --> 01:03:11.880
was to marry you.

01:03:15.890 --> 01:03:17.130
The Infinite Heat

01:03:18.920 --> 01:03:22.050
is at the Saber Tomb of the Hua residence in the back hill.

01:03:23.580 --> 01:03:26.510
You don't need to waste your energy in the front hill.

01:03:26.820 --> 01:03:29.220
Just send a few girls at the Chi and Mei level

01:03:29.820 --> 01:03:31.170
to stall Gong Ziyu.

01:03:36.630 --> 01:03:39.240
But the strength of the young people in the back hill

01:03:39.240 --> 01:03:40.970
far exceeded my expectations.

01:03:42.790 --> 01:03:44.430
You may face

01:03:46.000 --> 01:03:46.930
a fierce battle.

01:03:56.860 --> 01:03:58.520
No matter how big the storm is,

01:03:59.090 --> 01:04:00.040
it'll be over.

01:04:02.810 --> 01:04:05.040
I've got the Infinite Heat.

01:04:06.530 --> 01:04:08.730
I'll definitely eliminate the Wufeng.

01:04:09.180 --> 01:04:10.480
You don't know

01:04:11.970 --> 01:04:14.030
that people who use the Infinite Heat

01:04:14.700 --> 01:04:15.840
can't escape the harm

01:04:15.840 --> 01:04:17.750
of the Infinite Heat either.

01:04:19.240 --> 01:04:21.100
They'll be eliminated together.

01:04:22.710 --> 01:04:23.610
So

01:04:24.680 --> 01:04:26.140
I'll give all these things

01:04:26.150 --> 01:04:28.060
a perfect ending.

01:04:28.080 --> 01:04:28.880
Isn't it good?

01:04:30.460 --> 01:04:32.410
I'm already a dead person.

01:04:35.690 --> 01:04:37.620
Let me die an honorable death.

01:04:42.520 --> 01:04:43.210
Brother.

01:04:47.270 --> 01:04:49.200
You've committed too many crimes.

01:04:49.720 --> 01:04:50.630
Your killed

01:04:51.450 --> 01:04:53.110
many family members.

01:04:54.330 --> 01:04:55.590
It's not up to you.

01:05:06.740 --> 01:05:07.410
Brother.

01:05:09.640 --> 01:05:10.990
You can't defeat me.

01:05:12.620 --> 01:05:14.200
None of you can defeat me.

01:05:16.240 --> 01:05:17.180
Now,

01:05:18.490 --> 01:05:20.520
I'm going out of the Gong residence.

01:05:22.580 --> 01:05:23.740
If you don't stop me,

01:05:25.760 --> 01:05:27.630
the Gong family will be safe and sound

01:05:27.630 --> 01:05:28.930
from now on.

01:06:13.430 --> 01:06:14.690
People from the Wufeng

01:06:15.530 --> 01:06:16.280
are as weak

01:06:16.330 --> 01:06:17.040
as ants.

01:06:17.730 --> 01:06:19.190
I'm one of the Gong family.

01:06:22.540 --> 01:06:23.380
I used to be

01:06:24.810 --> 01:06:26.240
one of the Gong family too.
